{"book":"percentages","bookTitle":"Percentages","concept":3,"title":"Percentage of an amount","grades":"Grades 6–7","goal":"I can find a percentage of an amount.","teach":"Find 10% (÷ 10) or 1% (÷ 100) and build up: 35% of 240 = 30% + 5% = 72 + 12 = 84. Or multiply by the decimal: 35% of 240 = 0,35 × 240 = 84.","tvis":"<table class=\"tbl \"><thead><tr><th>Percentage of 240</th><th>10%</th><th>5%</th><th>1%</th><th>30%</th><th>35%</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Amount</td><td>24</td><td>12</td><td>2,4</td><td>72</td><td>84</td></tr></tbody></table>","ex":{"q":"Find 15% of R60.","steps":["10% of R60 = R6.","5% of R60 = R3 (half of 10%).","15% = R6 + R3 = R9."]},"watch":"30% of 90 means 0,3 × 90 = 27, not 90 ÷ 30.","qs":[{"text":"Find 25% of 84.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"21","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Quarter.","steps":"1. Formula: x% of an amount = x ÷ 100 × amount<br>2. 25% of 84 = 25 ÷ 100 × 84<br>3. = 84 ÷ 4<br>4. = 21"},{"text":"Find 15% of R60.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Amount (R)","a":"9","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"10% + 5%","steps":"1. Formula: x% of an amount = x ÷ 100 × amount<br>2. 15% of R60 = 15 ÷ 100 × 60<br>3. = 0,15 × 60<br>4. = R9"},{"text":"Find 35% of 240.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"84","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"30% + 5%","steps":"1. Formula: x% of an amount = x ÷ 100 × amount<br>2. 35% of 240 = 35 ÷ 100 × 240<br>3. = 0,35 × 240<br>4. = 84"}]}